{#- =====================================================================
  DN_Mgmt_Hardening_Cleanup | Day N / brownfield | Jinja2
  Target  : IOS-XE switches and routers already in inventory
  Purpose : Apply a management-plane baseline and remove known legacy
            items (old SNMP communities, old local accounts) that you
            name explicitly. A template cannot read the running config,
            so legacy items have to be listed. It will not find them.

  !! PRE-CHECKS before provisioning !!
   - Confirm the CLI credential Catalyst Center uses for this device
     is SSH, not Telnet. If ssh_only = true and the device is managed
     over Telnet, you will lock Catalyst Center out.
   - Do NOT put the account Catalyst Center logs in with into
     legacy_users.
   - Leave ip http(s) server alone if anything uses it (PnP, some
     Assurance/telemetry paths, web UI). That's why it's a toggle.

  Variables:
    ssh_only          boolean  optional   default true  (vty transport input ssh)
    exec_timeout      integer  optional   default 10 (minutes)
    vty_acl           string   optional   name of an existing ACL to apply on vty
    banner_text       string   optional   login banner text (no ^ characters)
    legacy_snmp       string   optional   comma separated community strings to remove
    legacy_users      string   optional   comma separated local usernames to remove
    disable_http      boolean  optional   default false
===================================================================== -#}
service password-encryption
service tcp-keepalives-in
service tcp-keepalives-out
service timestamps log datetime msec localtime show-timezone
no ip source-route
no service pad
ip ssh version 2
ip ssh time-out 60
ip ssh authentication-retries 3
login block-for 120 attempts 5 within 60
login on-failure log
!
{%- if disable_http | default('false', true) | string | lower == 'true' %}
no ip http server
no ip http secure-server
!
{%- endif %}
line vty 0 15
 exec-timeout {{ exec_timeout | default(10, true) }} 0
{%- if ssh_only | default('true', true) | string | lower == 'true' %}
 transport input ssh
{%- endif %}
{%- if vty_acl %}
 access-class {{ vty_acl }} in vrf-also
{%- endif %}
!
{%- if banner_text %}
banner login ^
{{ banner_text }}
^
!
{%- endif %}
{%- if legacy_snmp %}
{%- for c in legacy_snmp.split(',') %}
no snmp-server community {{ c | trim }}
{%- endfor %}
!
{%- endif %}
{%- if legacy_users %}
{%- for u in legacy_users.split(',') %}
no username {{ u | trim }}
{%- endfor %}
!
{%- endif %}
